Infuse your weapon with overwhelming gravitational power while spinning around.

All creatures within radius 2 take [85%, 100%, 111%, 121%, 130% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as physical (gravity) and are pulled closer.

Then, all adjacent creatures take [83%, 105%, 122%, 137%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.  This second strike shields you for between [133, 179, 215, 246, 272 (TL1-5; SP 100)] and [267, 359, 431, 492, 545 (TL1-5; SP 100)], increasing with more enemies hit.  The shield lasts for 2 turns.

The shield strength will increase with your Spellpower.
